+    section_hash: 0e06978d0ac963430495491d43e39108bdd6f4b8e5eb3759a5cb9fd2fd270d69
+    summary: VoiceRender 0.2.12 compatibility matrix
+    text: '### VoiceRender 0.2.12 compatibility matrix
+
+
+      | VoiceRender public `ModelArtifact` field | Readio projection | Current support
+      |
+
+      | --- | --- | --- |
+
+      | `engine` | `engine` | Available |
+
+      | `target_id` | `target` | Available |
+
+      | `display_name` | `label` | Available |
+
+      | `installed` | `installed` and consistency check for `state` | Available |
+
+      | `status` | `state` for recognized exact values, otherwise `unknown` | Available
+      as an open string |
+
+      | `revision` | `local_version` only when installed | Available, provider-defined
+      |
+
+      | `languages` | `language` only when exactly one language is reported | Available
+      |
+
+      | `qualities`, `installed_qualities` | No singular `quality` projection | Aggregate
+      lists only |
+
+      | `source` | No Readio field | Available upstream, not part of DTO |
+
+      | `path` | No storage path or identity projection | Available upstream, intentionally
+      not exposed |
+
+      | `metadata` | Not parsed | Open-ended upstream mapping, ignored |
+
+      | available revision, update comparison, byte sizes, storage identity, per-model
+      action support, progress callback | `None`, `unknown`, or unasserted action flags
+      | Not exposed by 0.2.12 |
+
+
+      VoiceRender operation results can include an optional `artifact`; Readio normalizes
+      it when present and otherwise queries model status. Readio does not inspect private
+      VoiceRender modules, infer cache paths, or turn provider/network failures into
+      `update_state="current"`.'
